        {
            "title": "【新盤開價】叡璟II首推均呎18,680元｜較同系叡璟I略高4.5%｜低維港滙一二手近3成",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">由華潤置地發展的長沙灣新盤叡璟II，今日（15日）公布首張價單，首批涉及85伙。扣除最高16%折扣優惠後，首批單位折實均呎為18,680元，折實入場價由542.6萬元起。參考區內市況，是次首批定價較同區同系叡璟I首推時輕微高出約4.47%；但對比鄰近半新屋苑維港滙系列的首批均價及近期二手成交呎價，則大幅低出近3成，定價貼市克制。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">據悉，發展商將於明日（16日）起開放示範單位並同步收票，預計短期內公布具體安排，最快於下周展開首輪銷售。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-b3df5458-30f5-3f4a-a46c-7ee32cb22d37-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">閱讀更多：</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"叡璟II價單\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:叡璟II價單;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4xRvpsd\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">叡璟II價單</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>首批85伙均呎18,680元 兩房呎價破2萬</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">發展商首張價單涉及85伙，實用面積由307至730平方呎，涵蓋21伙一房、38伙兩房及26伙三房戶。扣除最高16%折扣後，折實售價由542.6萬元起，最高1,413.9萬元；折實呎價介乎16,930至20,011元，折實均呎18,680元。按定價計，首批單位市值約9.48億元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">入場單位為5B座5樓D室，實用面積307平方呎，屬一房戶，折實售價542.6萬元，呎價約17,674元。兩房入場戶為5B座5樓F室，實用面積413平方呎，折實售價約699.2萬元，呎價約16,930元，同時為首張價單中呎價最低的一伙。三房入場戶則為5A座5樓A室，實用面積723平方呎，折實售價約1,337.4萬元，呎價約18,498元。至於首批呎價最高單位為5A座38樓E室兩房戶，實用面積459平方呎，折實售價918.5萬元，呎價約20,011元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>一手開價比較：較維港滙首推折讓近3成</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">叡璟II首批折實均呎為18,680元，對比今年8月同系叡璟I首批102伙折實均呎17,880元，加價約4.47%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇叡璟I最新價單】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇叡璟I最新價單】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/3TahLBc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇叡璟I最新價單】</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">若與同區半新盤維港滙系列的一手開價比較，叡璟II則有明顯折讓。維港滙I至維港滙III於2021年3月及8月期間先後開售，首批單位分別涉及108伙、108伙及78伙，當時折實均呎達24,628元、25,868元及26,658元。按此計算，叡璟II首批均價較維港滙系列大幅低出24.15%至29.93%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇維港滙I最新價單】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇維港滙I最新價單】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4qi9Cak\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇維港滙I最新價單】</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇維港滙II最新價單】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇維港滙II最新價單】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4xASUoX\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇維港滙II最新價單】</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇維港滙III最新價單】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇維港滙III最新價單】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/3PSqohR\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇維港滙III最新價單】</a></p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9af6513d4534ff26fd6a493fa1e04868134c24f6e4d831cfe2758f62dbbf5829/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2F28hse_com_210%2Fb9112e0e978e8846a15db3e755865677.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>叡璟II與同區一手盤首推資料</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>二手造價比較：一房入場呎價低同區近3成</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">除了對比一手開價，叡璟II的定價亦低於同區二手造價。根據<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"28Hse放盤紀錄\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:28Hse放盤紀錄;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4ip4jUt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">28Hse放盤紀錄</a>，與叡璟II相距約14分鐘步程、樓齡約4年的維港滙I，現時約有80個放盤，叫價由540萬至3,200萬元不等。成交方面，該盤一伙實用面積325平方呎的低層一房戶，近期以798萬元易手，實用呎價約24,554元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">相比之下，叡璟II首批一房入場戶折實呎價為17,674元，較上述維港滙I二手成交呎價低約28.02%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇維港滙I最新放盤】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇維港滙I最新放盤】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4ip4jUt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇維港滙I最新放盤】</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>景觀與地段各異　定價貼市務實</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">兩盤無論在一手還是二手市場均存在近3成的定價差距，正正反映景觀與地段屬性上的分別。維港滙系列主打臨海地段，環境清幽，私隱度高，距離南昌港鐵站步程僅約6分鐘；然而屋苑基座缺乏大型商場，起居飲食需依賴周邊屋苑。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">相反，叡璟II雖欠缺海景，但勝在位處成熟民生區，鄰近西九四小龍，日常購物與餐飲選擇更為豐富；步程至港鐵站需時約9至11分鐘，惟項目未來計劃以行人天橋網絡接駁南昌站，屆時住客出入可免受日曬雨淋。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">綜合而言，發展商順應市況，以平價作招徠，彌補項目欠缺海景及距港鐵站較遠的弱點，定價策略貼市克制。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>項目料明起開放示範單位　最快下周首輪推售</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">叡璟II明日（16日）將開放示範單位並同步收票，短期內公布銷售安排，最快下周展開首輪銷售。示範單位參照5B座28樓E室搭建，實用面積306平方呎，屬一房戶。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">項目屬發展計劃第5A及5B座，合共提供407伙，實用面積由269至730平方呎，涵蓋一至三房戶。樓盤小學為40校網，中學屬於深水埗區。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">項目預計關鍵日期為2028年12月25日，樓花期約27個月，較叡璟I遲近1個月落成。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">延伸閱讀: <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"維港滙\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:維港滙;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/estate/detail/維港滙I-23650\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">維港滙</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"叡璟\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:叡璟;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/estate/detail/叡璟-33991\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">叡璟</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"深水埗\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:深水埗;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/estate/detail/深水埗-27375\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">深水埗</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"長沙灣\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:長沙灣;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/estate/detail/長沙灣-27376\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">長沙灣</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"南昌\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:南昌;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/estate/detail/南昌-28412\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">南昌</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">延伸閱讀:</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">* <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"新聞連結\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:新聞連結;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/news/%E6%96%B0%E7%9B%A4%E9%96%8B%E5%83%B9-%E5%8F%A1%E7%92%9FII%E9%A6%96%E6%8E%A8%E5%9D%87%E5%91%8E18-680%E5%85%83-%E8%BC%83%E5%90%8C%E7%B3%BB%E5%8F%A1%E7%92%9FI%E7%95%A5%E9%AB%984-5-%E4%BD%8E%E7%B6%AD%E6%B8%AF%E6%BB%99%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8C%E6%89%8B%E8%BF%913%E6%88%90-77718\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">新聞連結</a>。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">* <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"28Hse App\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:28Hse App;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/appdownload\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">28Hse App</a>。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%96%B0%E7%9B%A4%E9%96%8B%E5%83%B9-%E5%8F%A1%E7%92%9Fii%E9%A6%96%E6%8E%A8%E5%9D%87%E5%91%8E18-680%E5%85%83-%E8%BC%83%E5%90%8C%E7%B3%BB%E5%8F%A1%E7%92%9Fi%E7%95%A5%E9%AB%984-5-105658471.html",
